  "captures/eg-esa-praytimes.html (today table, 78 city rows, 2026-11-11)",
  "captures/eg-esa-monthly.html (the 88-option city selector and the month selector)",
  "captures/eg-monthly/*.html (one monthly table per city, June 2026, 82 cities)"
