 },
 "provenance": "The record's EG-ESA object anchors one point (Cairo 30.0444/31.2357) and says '78 city rows inverted'. The 78-row table is this page. Re-read here on two dates to separate a coordinate table from a margin: the deltas MOVE with season, so this is a per-city computed table, not a published offset register.",
 "rowCount": 78,
 "seasonalTest": {
  "dates": [
   "2026-11-11",
   "2026-06-01..2026-06-30 (median)"
  ],
  "finding": "deltas are not constant across the year. Alexandria fajr +6 in November against 0 in June, isha +4 against +10. A fixed offset ladder cannot produce that; the table is computed per city.",
  "consequence": "the register must be banked as the city LIST plus the measured per-date deltas, never as one integer per city"
 },
 "defects": [
  "Four options in the publisher's own selector return an empty table: منوف, ديرب نجم, ابو تشت, سمالوط (82 of 86 city options render).",
  "The monthly endpoint has no year parameter, so only the current year is addressable on this surface.",
  "The published minutes are not zero-padded ('1:5 م' for 1:05 PM), which silently breaks a naive h:mm parser on the noon and asr columns."
 ],
